#. module: appointment
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:appointment.field_appointment_slot__slot_type
msgid ""
"Defines the type of slot. The regular slot is the default type which is used "
"for\n"
"        appointment type that are used recurringly in type like medical "
"appointment.\n"
"        The one shot type is only used when an user create a custom "
"appointment type for a client by\n"
"        defining non-recurring time slot (e.g. 10th of April 2021 from 10 to "
"11 am) from its calendar."
msgstr ""
"Mendefinisikan tipe timeslot. Timeslot reguler adalah tipe default yang "
"digunakan untuk\n"
"        tipe appointment yang digunakan secara berkala di tipe seperti "
"appointment medis.\n"
"        Tipe one shot hanya digunakan saat user membuat tipe appointment "
"kustom untuk klien dengan\n"
"        menetapkan timeslot yang tidak berulang (contoh 10 April 2021 dari "
"jam 10 sampai 11) dari kalender."

#. module: appointment
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:appointment.field_appointment_type__event_videocall_source
msgid ""
"Defines the type of video call link that will be used for the generated "
"events.\n"
"\n"
"            Can be one of:\n"
"                - Odoo Discuss: Generates an internal Odoo Discuss meeting "
"link.\n"
"                - Google Meet: Generates a Google Meet link. Requires Google "
"Calendar synchronization to be configured and active. If the staff user did "
"not synchronize their calendar, no Google Meet link will be added to their "
"meetings.\n"
"\n"
"            Keep it empty to prevent generating meeting url."
msgstr ""
"Menentukan jenis tautan panggilan video yang akan digunakan untuk acara yang "
"dibuat.\n"
"\n"
"            Dapat berupa:\n"
"                - Odoo Diskusi: Membuat tautan rapat internal Diskusi Odoo.\n"
"                - Google Meet: Membuat tautan Google Meet. Memerlukan "
"sinkronisasi Google Kalender yang telah dikonfigurasi dan aktif. Jika user "
"staf tidak menyinkronkan Kalendernya, tautan Google Meet tidak akan "
"ditambahkan ke meetingnya.\n"
"\n"
"            Kosongkan agar url meeting tidak terbuat."

